acc/clean-2 | Will Nvidia complete its announced $12.9 billion acquisition of Hugging Face, the open-source AI model repository, by a check date within 18 months of the September 2026 announcement? | Whether Nvidia closes (or abandons/restructures) the announced $12.9 billion purchase of Hugging Face, an acquisition that would absorb cash and add a developer-platform asset.
acc/clean-3 | How much will Nvidia have guaranteed or committed in credit support for AI infrastructure projects at its next annual report, after agreeing in August 2026 to provide guarantees of up to $105 billion for a data center project in Ohio? | The reported amount of Nvidia's guarantees / credit support for AI infrastructure projects, including the Ohio data center project, disclosed at its next annual report.
